    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d278">

                <pb facs="0459" n="429" xml:id="pg429"/>

                <head>278. Telegram From Operation PBSUCCESS Headquarters in
                        Florida to the CIA
                        Stations in Guatemala and [<hi rendition="#italic">place not
                        declassified</hi>]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d278-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>[<hi rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>], <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1954-07-13T00:47:00+00:00">July 13, 1954,
                        0047Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>4757. 1. LINCOLN closing Station 2400 hours 12 July.
                    Thereafter PBSUCCESS stations revert
                    WHD command.</p>
                <p>2. Please continue PBSUCCESS slug for
                    those matters relating to project or matters that would reveal existence of
                    same.</p>
                <p>3. Hope you enjoyed association as much as LINC
                    has. The book is now closed but the story was a good one. Thanks.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
